   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      69.6,
      531.36,
      78.48
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      79.68,
      535.68,
      89.04
     ],
     "text": "upright to bushy habit with flowers approximately the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      90.24,
      522.72,
      97.44
     ],
     "text": "same size as \u2018Kardinal\u2019 and \u2018Toscana\u2019. Flowers are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      100.08,
      526.08,
      108.48
     ],
     "text": "flattened convex in profile. Sepals have a moderate"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      109.92,
      553.44,
      117.6
     ],
     "text": "number of extensions. Seed vessels are small and funnel-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      120.0,
      555.6,
      129.36
     ],
     "text": "shaped. Fragrance is absent. Foliage is medium-green and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      130.8,
      442.08,
      139.2
     ],
     "text": "leaf upper surfaces are glossy."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.9236,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose of\nupright to bushy habit with flowers approximately the\nsame size as \u2018Kardinal\u2019 and \u2018Toscana\u2019. Flowers are\nflattened convex in profile. Sepals have a moderate\nnumber of extensions. Seed vessels are small and funnel-\nshaped. Fragrance is absent. Foliage is medium-green and\nleaf upper surfaces are glossy.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    320.4,
    154.32,
    552.72,
    220.56
   ],
   "confidence": null,
   "id": "e8",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      154.32,
      536.16,
      162.72
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has purple anthocyanin in the young"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      163.92,
      552.72,
      172.08
     ],
     "text": "shoots whereas \u2018Toscana\u2019 has none. \u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      174.24,
      531.84,
      182.64
     ],
     "text": "no prickles on the pedicel while \u2018Kardinal\u2019 has some."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      183.84,
      545.04,
      192.24
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has no basal spot on the outside of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      193.92,
      537.84,
      202.32
     ],
     "text": "petals unlike \u2018Kardinal\u2019 and \u2018Toscana\u2019. The petiolule in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      203.52,
      549.84,
      211.92
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is shorter than those of either \u2018Kardinal\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      213.84,
      370.56,
      220.56
     ],
     "text": "or \u2018Toscana\u2019."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.9369,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has purple anthocyanin in the young\nshoots whereas \u2018Toscana\u2019 has none. \u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has\nno prickles on the pedicel while \u2018Kardinal\u2019 has some.\n\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) has no basal spot on the outside of the\npetals unlike \u2018Kardinal\u2019 and \u2018Toscana\u2019. The petiolule in\n\u2018Coco\u2019 (Korferse) is shorter than those of either \u2018Kardinal\u2019\nor \u2018Toscana\u2019.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
